WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.768
Today the words have three sounds.

2
00:00:02.218 --> 00:00:09.030
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.109
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:17.388
Three sounds is much harder than two. So your child builds the word in two moves.

5
00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:22.334
Move one. Say the first two sounds, and slide them together with no gap.

6
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.848
Move two. Add the last sound.

7
00:00:28.136 --> 00:00:29.099
The word is sat.

8
00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:35.035
Each row on the page shows the two moves. Point to each box as your child says it.

9
00:00:35.485 --> 00:00:40.030
Do the first row together. Your child tries the next rows with you beside them.

10
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.822
Here is the second row, so you can hear it.

11
00:00:46.877 --> 00:00:47.893
The word is man.

12
00:00:48.793 --> 00:00:54.101
Then your child reads the words with dots. Touch each dot, and slide the sounds together.

13
00:00:54.551 --> 00:01:00.225
If a word will not come, go back to the first two sounds. Do not say the word for them right away.
